{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:55 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:55 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:55 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"「光輝歲月」終於捉到鹿\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/b35fc4af2c07ad4e696fd05a54fee72a/2026-11/r3_3.jpg\"/><p>今日編有三場泥地賽事，路程全是一六五○米，結果第三場五班賽事，由周俊樂策騎的游廄「光輝歲月」反先續配黃寶妮爭連捷的東廄「一鹿歡騰 」，贏得歷來第二場勝仗。之前兩仗，「光輝歲月」都與「一鹿歡騰 」同場而成績遜於對方。周俊樂季內已第七次助游達榮贏馬，兩人合作如魚得水。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.174351+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:55:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:40.581101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:53.925467+00:00","content_hash":"e022ed2425793ab3874a2d32810ebb6f0783f78cb70c3c26907c35db85813061","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}